																			<svg class="size-4 -mb-0.5" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 11h2v5m-2 0h4m-2.592-8.5h.01M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z"></path> </svg>
